 "text": "Event Map \nSponsors\nTransit\nDirections\nAbout\nEntertainment\nFood + Drinks\nArt\nFeatures\nSchedule\nWeigh-Off\nHalf Moon Bay Pumpkin Festival\nOctober 17-18, 2026\nJoin us October 17-18, 2026 to celebrate the spectacular 54th Annual Half Moon Bay Art & Pumpkin Festival! \nThe Safeway World Championship Pumpkin Weigh-Off\n kicks off festivities on Monday, October 12, on the IDES Grounds.\nSee the 2026 Pumpkin Weigh-Off Results!\nThe Grand Champion Pumpkin (and four heaviest overall) will be part of a special display at the Half Moon Bay Art & Pumpkin Festival, Saturday and Sunday, October 17-18, 2026 from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. on historic Main Street. Get your photo taken with the grand champion gourd!\nAbout the Event\nSafeway “Ingredients for Life”\nPumpkin Festival Merchandise\nMoonlight Movie Night\nThe Great Pumpkin Parade\nParade Grand Marshal Sergio Romo\nHalf Moon Bay Pumpkin Run\nSchedule of Events\nPumpkin Carving\nFarmer Mike Celebrates 40 Years at the Half Moon Bay Pumpkin Festival\nDirections & Map\nGiant Pumpkin Photos\nHarvest Moon Lounge\nXfinity Take 5 Lounge\nLodging Information\nPie Eating Contests\nCostume Contest\nCoastal Fall Guide\nPresented by\nthe Half Moon Bay Beautification Committee\n(HMBBC) as a Community Benefit\nLEARN MORE...\nDONATE TO HMBBC\nThe \nHalf Moon Bay Beautification Committee\n salutes \nSafeway\n for its commitment to the community. Safeway has been the \nPumpkin Weigh-Off\n title sponsor since 1990 and has been an instrumental partner in the Weigh-Off's tremendous success.\nOfficial Wine Sponsor\nWe are proud to partner with Xfinity\nPROUDLY SPONSORED BY\nSponsors\nHome\nFAQ\nSchedule of Events\nDirections & Map\nPhotos\nBecome a Sponsor\nMegalith\nPress Kit\nCelebrating the Great & Almighty Gourd\nOctober 17-18, 2026 – \n9am to 5pm\nMain Street, Half Moon Bay, CA\nGET SOCIAL WITH US\n© \nHalf Moon Bay Beautification Committee.  All rights reserved. \nPrivacy Policy\n | \nSite Map\nSite developed and hosted by \n